  "description": "Meter ingest + summary surface for the Stylobot FOSS dashboard. Ships IMeterStream + LocalMeterStream (MeterListener) + RemoteMeterStream (Prometheus text scrape) + the shared LFU MeterSummaryAtom storage, plus the dashboard's meter-health tile (IPackHealthSummaryProvider seam). Read-only data plane; signal-emission hook for blackboard adapters. No write surfaces. Optional add-on pack -- the dashboard UI does not depend on it.",
